<title>INDIA: Bank of India 1996/97 net up at 4.48 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>Bank of India 1996/97 net up at 4.48 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run Bank of India said on Wednesday its net profit for the year ended March 31, 1997 rose to 4.48 billion rupees from 2.76 billion a year ago.</p>
</text>
